; https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/master/pages/common/planmaker.md

% planmaker, common

# Launch the spreadsheet application with a new blank document
planmaker

# Open an existing file with PlanMaker
planmaker <path_to_file_pmdx>

# Launch PlanMaker with [N]o open documents
planmaker -N
